# demo_64k_pbr_post.lt
# Procedural 64k-style PBR/deferred demo for lazyTool DX11.
# No external assets, external textures, GLTF, Gaussian Splats, compute shaders, GitHub snippets or third-party shader code are used. V3 adds a procedural sky/IBL and higher-quality postprocesses.
# Visible geometry is only cube and sphere primitives; fullscreen_triangle is used only by post/deferred passes.

lazyTool_project 1

camera_fps 0 1.65 -6.2 0 -0.13 0.82 0.05 80 0

dirlight -3.8 7.2 -4.4 0 0 0 1 0.88 0.72 4.2 2048 2048 0.05 45 11 11 4 34 0.72 5.5 8 8 0.05 18 12 13 13 0.05 26 22 23 23 0.05 38 34 36 36 0.05 55

export_settings 1 1 0 1 1 1

resources
resource mesh_primitive mesh_cube cube
resource mesh_primitive mesh_sphere sphere
resource mesh_primitive mesh_fullscreen fullscreen_triangle
resource render_texture rt_gbuf_normal 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_gbuf_albedo 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_gbuf_emissive 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_hdr_scene 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_ssao_raw 1 1 28 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_ssao_tmp 1 1 28 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_ssao_blur 1 1 28 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_bloom_a 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_bloom_b 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_bloom_q_a 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 4
resource render_texture rt_bloom_q_b 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 4
resource render_texture rt_bloom_e_a 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 8
resource render_texture rt_bloom_e_b 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 8
resource render_texture rt_bloom_final 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 2
resource render_texture rt_dof_coc 1 1 28 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_dof_scene 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 1
resource render_texture rt_lens_flare 1 1 10 1 1 0 0 2
resource value float4 PostBloomParams 0 0 0 0 1.08 0.42 0.58 0.55
resource value float4 PostAOParams 0 0 0 0 1.45 1.08 0.045 1.03
resource value float4 PostDOFParams 0 0 0 0 7 0.42 7.5 0
resource value float4 PostFlareParams 0 0 0 0 1.35 0.36 0.43 2.15
resource value float4 PostGradeParams 0 0 0 0 0.02 1.05 0.94 0.68
resource value float4 ColorGrade 0 0 0 0 1.04 0.99 0.92 0.42
resource value float GrainAmount 0 0 0 0 0.009 0 0 0
resource value float4 SunColorTuning 0 0 0 0 1.04 0.96 0.86 0.70
resource value float4 MaterialGlobalTuning 0 0 0 0 0.96 1 0.58 1
resource value float4 SkyParams 0 0 0 0 1.25 0.58 0.75 0.08
resource value float4 SkyTint 0 0 0 0 0.76 0.88 1.12 0.92
resource value float4 ClearDark 0 0 0 0 0.004 0.006 0.011 1
resource shader_vsps shader_gbuffer_pbr shaders/demo64k/gbuffer_pbr.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_lighting_pbr shaders/demo64k/lighting_pbr.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_ssao shaders/demo64k/ssao.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_blur_bilateral shaders/demo64k/blur_bilateral.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_bloom_prefilter shaders/demo64k/bloom_prefilter.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_bloom_downsample shaders/demo64k/bloom_downsample.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_bloom_blur shaders/demo64k/bloom_blur.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_bloom_combine shaders/demo64k/bloom_combine.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_dof_coc shaders/demo64k/dof_coc.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_dof_blur shaders/demo64k/dof_blur.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_lens_flare_hex shaders/demo64k/lens_flare_hex.hlsl
resource shader_vsps shader_composite_tonemap shaders/demo64k/composite_tonemap.hlsl
resource_note mesh_cube|mesh Visible geometry primitive only. The demo deliberately avoids GLTF, splats, external textures and any asset file.
resource_note mesh_sphere|mesh Visible geometry primitive only. Spheres receive all material detail procedurally in gbuffer_pbr.hlsl.
resource_note mesh_fullscreen|mesh Fullscreen triangle is used only for post-processing / deferred passes, never as visible scene geometry.
resource_note PostBloomParams|float4 x BloomThreshold, y BloomKnee, z BloomIntensity, w wide-bloom blend. V3 uses multi-scale half/quarter/eighth bloom for a softer professional glow.
resource_note PostAOParams|float4 x AORadius, y AOIntensity, z AOBias, w AOPower. V3 SSAO uses stable spiral sampling plus two-pass bilateral denoise for less crawling/noise.
resource_note PostDOFParams|float4 x DOFFocusDistance, y DOFAperture, z DOFMaxBlur pixels, w unused. V3 stores near/far CoC and uses a 24-tap hex bokeh gather.
resource_note PostFlareParams|float4 x LensFlareThreshold, y LensFlareIntensity, z ghost spacing, w hex sharpness. The shader is custom and procedural; no GitHub/external code used.
resource_note PostGradeParams|float4 x Exposure, y Contrast, z Saturation, w Vignette. Final tonemap uses ACES from shaders/common.hlsl plus subtle grading.
resource_note ColorGrade|float4 rgb ColorGrade multiplier, w subtle chromatic aberration amount. Keep w low for a 64k-style polished look.
resource_note GrainAmount|float Very subtle procedural film grain amount in composite_tonemap.hlsl. No texture is used.
resource_note SunColorTuning|float4 rgb warm sunlight tint multiplier, w ambient amount. Directional light and cascaded shadow data come from SceneCB/common.hlsl.
resource_note SkyParams|float4 x sky intensity, y sun disk/glow, z horizon warmth, w procedural stars. No cubemap or external texture is used.
resource_note SkyTint|float4 rgb sky tint, w reflection/IBL strength. Lighting uses the procedural sky for ambient diffuse and glossy sky reflections.
resource_note MaterialGlobalTuning|float4 x roughness scale, y metalness scale, z procedural micro-detail, w emissive boost. Shared by all gbuffer material commands.
resource_note rt_gbuf_normal|render_texture2d GBuffer target 0: encoded world normal in rgb and roughness in alpha.
resource_note rt_gbuf_albedo|render_texture2d GBuffer target 1: procedural base color in rgb and metalness in alpha.
resource_note rt_gbuf_emissive|render_texture2d GBuffer target 2: HDR emissive color from procedural neon material.
resource_note rt_hdr_scene|render_texture2d Linear HDR lighting buffer before bloom, DOF and tonemap.
resource_note rt_ssao_raw|render_texture2d Half-resolution procedural SSAO output before denoise. Raw preview will still look noisy; final lighting reads rt_ssao_blur.
resource_note rt_ssao_tmp|render_texture2d Half-resolution temporary texture for the first separable bilateral SSAO blur pass.
resource_note rt_ssao_blur|render_texture2d Half-resolution final bilateral SSAO. Lighting reads this to darken ambient only.
resource_note rt_bloom_a|render_texture2d Half-resolution bloom ping-pong A / final blurred bloom.
resource_note rt_bloom_b|render_texture2d Half-resolution bloom ping-pong B.
resource_note rt_bloom_q_a|render_texture2d Quarter-resolution bloom pyramid A for wider glow.
resource_note rt_bloom_q_b|render_texture2d Quarter-resolution bloom pyramid B for wider glow.
resource_note rt_bloom_e_a|render_texture2d Eighth-resolution bloom pyramid A for large-radius soft glow.
resource_note rt_bloom_e_b|render_texture2d Eighth-resolution bloom pyramid B for large-radius soft glow.
resource_note rt_bloom_final|render_texture2d Combined multi-scale bloom read by flare and final composite.
resource_note rt_dof_coc|render_texture2d Circle-of-confusion buffer from scene depth. R is absolute CoC, G near foreground CoC, B far background CoC.
resource_note rt_dof_scene|render_texture2d HDR scene after cheap depth-of-field blur, still linear.
resource_note rt_lens_flare|render_texture2d Procedural hex/ghost flare buffer generated from bloom highlights. No external assets or code used.
resource_note shader_gbuffer_pbr|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/gbuffer_pbr.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_lighting_pbr|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/lighting_pbr.hlsl; V3 adds procedural sky background and sky-driven ambient/specular IBL; authored from scratch, no GitHub/external snippets.
resource_note shader_ssao|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/ssao.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_blur_bilateral|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/blur_bilateral.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_bloom_prefilter|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/bloom_prefilter.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_bloom_downsample|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Downsamples the bloom pyramid with a tent filter; authored from scratch, no GitHub/external snippets.
resource_note shader_bloom_blur|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/bloom_blur.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_bloom_combine|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Combines half/quarter/eighth bloom into rt_bloom_final; authored from scratch, no GitHub/external snippets.
resource_note shader_dof_coc|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/dof_coc.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_dof_blur|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/dof_blur.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_lens_flare_hex|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/lens_flare_hex.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.
resource_note shader_composite_tonemap|shader Shader Model 5 VS/PS pass. Source is shaders/demo64k/composite_tonemap.hlsl; authored from scratch for this project, no GitHub or external snippets.

user_cb
user_var PostBloomParams float4 PostBloomParams|float4 0 0 0 0 1.08 0.42 0.58 0.55
user_var PostAOParams float4 PostAOParams|float4 0 0 0 0 1.45 1.08 0.045 1.03
user_var PostDOFParams float4 PostDOFParams|float4 0 0 0 0 7 0.42 7.5 0
