user_var PostGradeParams float4 PostGradeParams|float4 0 0 0 0 0.02 1.05 0.94 0.68
user_var ColorGrade float4 ColorGrade|float4 0 0 0 0 1.04 0.99 0.92 0.42
user_var GrainAmount float GrainAmount|float 0 0 0 0 0.009 0 0 0
user_var SunColorTuning float4 SunColorTuning|float4 0 0 0 0 1.04 0.96 0.86 0.70
user_var MaterialGlobalTuning float4 MaterialGlobalTuning|float4 0 0 0 0 0.96 1 0.58 1
user_var SkyParams float4 SkyParams|float4 0 0 0 0 1.25 0.58 0.75 0.08
